NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000065 "################################################################################"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000066 "##"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000067 "##  In XML::Parser's output, a node is an Array whose first element is a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000068 "##  Hash of NVP's that represent that tag's attributes.  Subsequent"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000069 "##  elements alternate between text and child nodes."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000070 "##"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000071 "##  conform() prepends an empty hash to the output structure to ensure it"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000072 "##  conforms to this node definition."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000073 "##"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000074 "################################################################################"
