NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000663 "related modules or operating system documentation (such as man pages"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000664 "in UNIX), or any relevant external documentation such as RFCs or"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000665 "standards."
